    Full browser width, background: solid 
    #141414
    Vertical padding: 110px top, 110px bottom (desktop) / 60px top, 60px bottom (mobile)
    All content wrapped in an inner container, max-width: 640px, margin: 0 auto, text-align: center
    Content is vertically stacked, horizontally centered — no left/right misalignment, everything on same center axis
    
    EXACT COPY (use word-for-word, do not paraphrase):
    
    Line 1 (eyebrow):
    
    THE FORMULA
    
    Line 2 (heading, 2 lines):
    
    Skin Longevity
    System5
    
    Line 3 (subtext, 2 lines):
    
    Five biological processes, supported at once. This is what
    holds the result after the bottle is empty.
    
    ELEMENT-BY-ELEMENT SPEC:
    
    Eyebrow — "THE FORMULA"
    Position: top of stack, centered
    Font-size: 14px, font-weight: 600
    Letter-spacing: 4px (wide tracking, uppercase)
    Color: 
    #B08D57 (muted gold)
    Margin-bottom: 24px
    Heading — "Skin Longevity System5"
    Two separate lines using <br> or block display, NOT wrapped by browser — force the line break exactly where shown ("Skin Longevity" / "System5")
    Font-size: 60px desktop / 38px mobile
    Font-weight: 400 (light-medium, not bold)
    Line-height: 1.15
    Color: 
    #FFFFFF for all text
    EXCEPTION: the digit "5" at the end of "System5" must be a separate <span> colored 
    #B08D57 (same gold as eyebrow) — rest of "System" stays white, no space between "System" and "5"
    Margin-bottom: 44px
    Text-align: center, font-family: sans-serif (Inter/Poppins/General Sans style)
    Subtext
    Font-size: 18px, font-weight: 400
    Color: 
    #9E9E9E
    Line-height: 1.6
    Max-width: 560px, centered (margin: 0 auto)
    Two lines exactly as shown — keep natural wrap at these widths, center-aligned text-align
    
    ALIGNMENT RULES (critical):
    
    Every element (eyebrow, heading, subtext) shares the same center vertical axis — no offset
    No bullet points, no icons, no buttons, no images — pure centered text block
    Equal breathing room above eyebrow and below subtext (symmetrical section padding)
    Section must be self-contained; wrap it in its own <section> so it doesn't inherit spacing from adjacent sections
    
    RESPONSIVE:
    
    Mobile: heading 38px, subtext 16px, padding reduces to 60px top/bottom, container padding 24px left/right so text doesn't touch screen edges
    
    Make it a Shopify section with schema settings (eyebrow text, heading text, subtext, gold color picker) so it's editable from the theme customizer. Do not touch any other section, block, or existing code on the page., Full detailed prompt — combines build + fix, paste this once to AI coding tool:
    
    PROMPT:
    
    Update the existing "Formula Intro" dark section on this Shopify product page (the section with "THE FORMULA" label). Do not touch, restructure, or affect any other section/element on the page — apply changes strictly inside this section's file/block only.
    
    1. SECTION CONTAINER
    
    Full-width section, background: solid 
    #141414
    Padding: 110px top / 110px bottom on desktop, 60px top / 60px bottom on mobile
    Inner content wrapper: max-width 640px, margin: 0 auto, text-align: center
    Wrap this section in its own isolated <section> tag so no external CSS/classes bleed in
    
    2. EXACT COPY (word-for-word, do not change)
    
    Eyebrow:
    
    THE FORMULA
    
    Heading (must render as 2 separate lines, not 1):
    
    Skin Longevity
    System5
    
    Subtext (2 lines):
    
    Five biological processes, supported at once. This is what
    holds the result after the bottle is empty.
    
    3. EYEBROW STYLING
    
    Font-size: 14px, font-weight: 600
    Letter-spacing: 4px, uppercase
    Color: 
    #B08D57 (muted gold)
    Margin-bottom: 24px
    Centered
    
    4. HEADING STYLING
    
    Force hard line break between "Skin Longevity" and "System5" using <br> or two block spans — never allow natural text-wrap to decide the break
    Font-size: 60px desktop / 38px mobile
    Font-weight: 400
    Line-height: 1.15
    Color: 
    #FFFFFF for all text
    The digit "5" in "System5" must be inside its own <span> with color 
    #B08D57 (gold) — no space between "System" and "5", rest of word stays white
    Margin-bottom: 44px
    Centered, sans-serif font (Inter/Poppins/General Sans style)
    
    5. SUBTEXT STYLING
    
    Font-size: 18px, font-weight: 400
    Color: 
    #9E9E9E
    Line-height: 1.6
    Max-width: 560px, centered
    Two lines as shown, centered text-align
    
    6. REMOVE BROKEN/STRAY ELEMENTS
    
    Delete any partial circle/shape elements currently appearing at the top-right corner of this section — locate the pseudo-element, icon, or leftover decorative shape causing this and remove it from this section only, without affecting shared classes used elsewhere
    Delete the stray blue horizontal bar appearing above this section, only if it originates from this section's code; if it's a shared/global element used on other pages, leave it untouched
    
    7. ALIGNMENT RULES
    
    Eyebrow, heading, and subtext must all sit on the same centered vertical axis
    No icons, buttons, images, borders, or bullets — pure centered typography block
    Symmetrical spacing above eyebrow and below subtext
    
    8. RESPONSIVE
    
    Mobile: heading 38px, subtext 16px, section padding 60px top/bottom, container side padding 24px so text doesn't touch screen edges
    
    9. SHOPIFY SCHEMA
    
    Keep/add schema settings so eyebrow text, heading text, subtext, and gold color are all editable via theme customizer
    Preserve any existing schema settings already in place — only extend, don't remove
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-formula-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top_desktop }}px 24px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_desktop }}px;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .ai-formula-intro__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-formula-intro__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_weight }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_letter_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_margin_bottom }}px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_weight }};
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_margin_bottom }}px;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  /* Force typewriter text to inherit the correct weight during animation */
  .ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} .hp-typewriter-text,
  .ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} .hp-heading-line,
  .ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} .hp-typewriter-live,
  .ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} .hp-typewriter-sizer,
  .ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} .hp-heading-accent,
  .ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} [class*="hp-typewriter"] {
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_weight }} !important;
  }

  .ai-formula-intro__heading-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-formula-intro__subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtext_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtext_weight }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtext_color }};
    max-width: {{ block.settings.subtext_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-formula-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px 24px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-formula-intro__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-formula-intro__subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtext_size_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<section class="ai-formula-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-formula-intro__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.eyebrow_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-formula-intro__eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.eyebrow_text }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.heading_line1 != blank or block.settings.heading_line2_part1 != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-formula-intro__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-no-typewriter="true">
        {% if block.settings.heading_line1 != blank %}
          {{ block.settings.heading_line1 }}<br>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.heading_line2_part1 != blank %}
          {{ block.settings.heading_line2_part1 }}{% if block.settings.heading_line2_part2 != blank %}<span class="ai-formula-intro__heading-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_line2_part2 }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      </h2>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.subtext != blank %}
      <div class="ai-formula-intro__subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.subtext }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

